+ *   - f32/bf16 lanes are compared with _mm512_cmp_ps_mask (bf16 widening to
+ *     f32 is exact);
+ *   - integer/bool lanes are widened to 64-bit and compared signed/unsigned
+ *     with _mm512_cmp_epi64_mask / _mm512_cmp_epu64_mask;
+ *   - where selects with _mm512_mask_blend_ps / _mm512_mask_blend_epi64 and
+ *     quiet-NaNs float results exactly like the host Python-float round trip.
+ * The stride odometer that gathers broadcast/strided lanes is scalar C: it is
+ * native data movement, never a Python element list.
